                definition="#93aadbc9-246e-4a0b-9571-805e6660044c" value="[&quot;Tube, monocoque and hybrid alternatives remain unresolved.&quot;,&quot;The source F.5.1.1 and F.3.2.1 references to F.3.4.4 are retained as published; F.3.5 actually contains the aluminum provisions. Seek official clarification rather than silently changing the reference.&quot;]"/>
