              ReqIFIdentifier="FSAE2027:VP:obligation:TUBE-APPLICATION" ReqIFLongName="FSAE2027:VP Apply tubing classes and material restrictions"
              requirementType="#f8e4778c-4fd3-4570-94cf-86b53014d474" ReqIFText="Assign steel tube classes by application: A for front hoop, main hoop and shoulder-harness mounting bar; B for front bulkhead, front-hoop bracing, side-impact structure, main-hoop bracing, harness attachment and battery mounting/protection; C for front-bulkhead supports, main-hoop brace supports, shoulder-bar bracing, component protection and structural tubing; D for bent upper side-impact members. Aluminum is prohibited for the main hoop, main-hoop bracing and shoulder-harness mounting bar; it is permitted conditionally for the other listed applications. Tubing below the structural class is nonstructural and cannot be credited for rule compliance.">
