          <ownedRequirements xsi:type="Requirements:Requirement" id="1da590a7-0bc3-4f12-8db0-17ca7f7bb5d3"
              ReqIFIdentifier="FSAE2027:VP:obligation:DRIVER-TEMPLATE" ReqIFLongName="FSAE2027:VP Use the prescribed template and inspection position"
              requirementType="#f8e4778c-4fd3-4570-94cf-86b53014d474" ReqIFText="Represent hips/buttocks and shoulder/cervical regions by two 200 mm circles and helmeted head by a 300 mm circle, with tangent neck lines. Centers of the 200 mm circles are 490 mm apart; shoulder-to-head centers are 280 mm apart. Place the seat rearmost and pedals most forward; the lower-circle center is at least 915 mm from the pedals' rearmost face, the middle circle rests on the seat back and the head circle is no more than 25 mm from the head restraint in the driving helmet location.">
