          <ownedRequirements xsi:type="Requirements:Requirement" id="7d3faed0-b9c9-45da-855b-76902f999053"
              ReqIFIdentifier="FSAE2027:VP:obligation:IA-SELECTION" ReqIFLongName="FSAE2027:VP Retain standard/custom attenuator and bulkhead-support alternatives"
              requirementType="#f8e4778c-4fd3-4570-94cf-86b53014d474" ReqIFText="Select an approved event-site standard attenuator or design/test a custom one. A custom IA has fore/aft length at least 200 mm and height at least 100 mm by width at least 200 mm for at least 200 mm ahead of the bulkhead. Bond all segmented foam pieces against sliding/parallelogram distortion; place continuous panels between segments of multisegment honeycomb. If the bulkhead outside profile exceeds 400 mm by 350 mm or standard honeycomb is used, provide a full-opening diagonal/X support of class C or equivalent for monocoques, with each end carrying at least 30 kN in any direction, or perform F.8.8.6/.7 tests proving permanent AIP deflection is at most 25 mm.">
