              ReqIFIdentifier="FSAE2027:VP:obligation:FRONT-FORCE" ReqIFLongName="FSAE2027:VP Combine attenuator and other frontal-object forces"
              requirementType="#f8e4778c-4fd3-4570-94cf-86b53014d474" ReqIFText="The combined IA assembly force and force to crush/detach other objects ahead of AIP cannot exceed the F.8.8.2 peak deceleration; leave out outboard wheel assemblies and any lightweight bodywork or nosecone. Use peak loads 95 kN for standard foam,60 kN for standard honeycomb or the measured peak for a tested IA. Demonstrate the total by testing IA and noncrushable objects together, or testing objects alone and adding the specified IA peak; alternatively calculate mounting failure from link buckling, fastener shear or tearout and add the corresponding IA peak.">
