          <ownedRequirements xsi:type="Requirements:Requirement" id="86b9bbaa-0d59-4863-a2c5-59c9c24d91a1"
              ReqIFIdentifier="FSAE2027:VP:obligation:IA-PERFORMANCE" ReqIFLongName="FSAE2027:VP Keep the functional impact reference separate from test criteria"
              requirementType="#f8e4778c-4fd3-4570-94cf-86b53014d474" ReqIFText="Include an IAD report in SES. At the rule's reference total vehicle mass 300 kg and impact speed 7.0 m/s, the IA functional requirement is average deceleration at most 20 g, peak at most 40 g and absorbed energy strictly above 7350 J. The source explicitly identifies these as functional requirements rather than test requirements. This does not assign a 300 kg design mass to the actual car.">
