          <ownedRequirements xsi:type="Requirements:Requirement" id="7f3e338e-341a-463c-9e93-64bb688ec727"
              ReqIFIdentifier="FSAE2027:VP:obligation:HEAD" ReqIFLongName="FSAE2027:VP Provide and substantiate adjustable head restraint"
              requirementType="#f8e4778c-4fd3-4570-94cf-86b53014d474" ReqIFText="Limit rearward head movement with a vertical/near-vertical head restraint entirely inside the rollover envelope or permitted head-restraint protection. Do not attach other items to its material/structure or place items 25 mm or less away. Attach near top and bottom with strength at any load point strictly above 900 N rearward and 300 N lateral/vertical. For every driver, helmet rear gap is at most 25 mm and contact at least 50 mm from every edge. Approximate 100 mm longitudinal adjustment or multiple thicknesses is a source accommodation suggestion. Padding satisfiesSFI 45.2 or specified blue CONFOR CF45/CF45M underFIA List 17, is at least 38 mm thick and 15 cm wide, and has either area at least 235 cm^2 plus total height adjustment at least 17.5 cm or height at least 28 cm. Cover it with thin flexible material and an approximately 20 mm inspection hole on a nonfront surface.">
            <ownedAttributes xsi:type="Requirements:StringValueAttribute" id="2fd06a20-4449-42c9-9874-20df2b9a531c"
                definition="#f28516c8-9d0f-4e03-b0f2-cefc6667b433" value="FSAE-2027-V1"/>
