                  definition="#2192a479-2677-4c2f-ac4b-2ef73ca51d15" value="The tree exists only for the safety slices. charging, thermal, aerodynamics, fasteners and running-gear have no child CI. powertrain holds only two shutdown and torque-inhibit HWCIs (no motor, inverter or driveline assembly), and energy-storage holds only the BMS safety monitor CI (no accumulator container, segments or cells, which is usually the largest cost assembly on an EV). A missing assembly costs the most under Method A."/>
