        <ownedRequirements xsi:type="Requirements:Folder" id="a1816c7b-abbc-4064-ad36-7c9d13aae742"
            ReqIFIdentifier="FSAE2027:SUB:PRES" ReqIFLongName="FSAE2027:SUB PRES Presentation Event (Business Presentation) pre-event submission, Table PS-1 row &quot;Presentation (if required)&quot;, S.2.4"
            requirementType="#f8e4778c-4fd3-4570-94cf-86b53014d474" ReqIFText="The Presentation Event is a 75-point static event (S.1:p001). The team pitches a business, logistics, production or technical case for its car to a judging panel that is not all engineers (S.2.1, S.2.2.5). The rulebook does not set what the submission contains. Under S.2.4.1 and Table PS-1 row p007, a pre-event submission exists only if that year's Presentation Concept asks for one. The Concept is published on the Event Website (fsaeonline.com, Series Resources) and may change for each competition (S.2.2.1, S.2.2.2). It sets the content, file format, due date and any extra penalties (S.2.4.1, S.2.4.3). Any submission is uploaded to the team account before the Due Date by a Team Member or Team Captain. Late or missing uploads are penalised under the PS rules, in Table PS-2 group &quot;Other&quot;. The penalty is -20 points for each 24 hours late, with any part of a day counting as a full day, applied with official discretion (PS.3.2.1, PS.1.2.6). A Not Submitted document removes the team from the event with a score of zero (PS.3.2.2, TABLE-PS-2:p004). The Concept may set different penalties (S.2.4.3). Judges may include the submission in the event score (S.2.4.2). At the event, the team presents live in its assigned slot, and the judges then ask questions (S.2.3, S.2.5). The 2027 Concept was not available for this research, so every content item is marked as defined by the Concept and still to be determined. Background material found on the web (older event guides and team pages) is not authoritative and has not been used as fact. Model state: the S.1, S.2, PS and Table PS-1/PS-2 rule paragraphs are in the model but not traced to any element. It also holds two operational activities owned by Team personnel, &quot;FSAE2027:process Prepare and document competition entry&quot; and &quot;FSAE2027:process Inspect and present the vehicle&quot;. Each is only a name, with no description, exchanges, capability involvement or requirement links. The only content the model can supply is a description of the vehicle as entered (S.2.2.4), drawn from SA, LA, PA and EPBS. Its specifications are TBD because the DEC-* decisions are still open. No item is fully present in the model. The six vehicle-content items are partial: their anchor elements exist by name but carry no description or values, and the values wait on the DEC-* decisions. Every other item is absent. The model treats competition administration as a team process, so the two process activities are the anchors.">
          <ownedAttributes xsi:type="Requirements:StringValueAttribute" id="1f6072c1-b399-49b6-9618-d48619566c0b"
              definition="#2accec6a-53af-443b-ac05-920a9e2f77d8" value="FSAE2027:submissions-v1"/>
          <ownedAttributes xsi:type="Requirements:StringValueAttribute" id="1a6bffcd-c81c-4fae-8e48-03a4e7f4357e"
              definition="#f28516c8-9d0f-4e03-b0f2-cefc6667b433" value="FSAE-2027-V1"/>
          <ownedAttributes xsi:type="Requirements:StringValueAttribute" id="26c365a4-fc61-41c7-ac72-25996336795f"
              definition="#24357558-2768-408a-b07d-be62178d9e15" value="f71df5552e341dab1b58f1ff47212e7281953d66b9c41833de8347560913ed0e"/>
          <ownedAttributes xsi:type="Requirements:StringValueAttribute" id="261898bf-73a5-4a66-8e87-c0dfffc326e3"
              definition="#abd36e5a-eaa7-47b8-8c54-0e0cdbabce20" value="PRES"/>
          <ownedAttributes xsi:type="Requirements:StringValueAttribute" id="a4d0e255-e699-4bec-aab4-1a5517e0c94e"
              definition="#8418021d-4a12-4509-ab78-bf1394b884d6" value="[&quot;S.1 (FSAE-2027-V1:S.1:p001) - Presentation event point value 75&quot;,&quot;S.2.1 (FSAE-2027-V1:S.2.1:p001) - event objective: business/logistics/production/technical case aimed at outside investors&quot;,&quot;S.2.2.1-S.2.2.6 (FSAE-2027-V1:S.2.2.1:p001 .. S.2.2.6:p002) - Presentation Concept published on Event Website, may change per competition, must be met, must relate to the vehicle as entered, mixed-discipline judges, setting may vary&quot;,&quot;S.2.3 (FSAE-2027-V1:S.2.3:p001) - missing the assigned slot scores zero&quot;,&quot;S.2.4.1-S.2.4.3 (FSAE-2027-V1:S.2.4.1:p001, S.2.4.2:p001, S.2.4.3:p001) - pre-event submission if the Concept requires it, may be graded, penalties under PS or the Concept&quot;,&quot;S.2.5.1-S.2.5.5 (FSAE-2027-V1:S.2.5.1:p001 .. S.2.5.5:p001) - presenters, presence and introduction, time limit, Q&amp;A after presentation, only qualified members answer&quot;,&quot;S.2.6 (FSAE-2027-V1:S.2.6:p001) - equipment per the Concept&quot;,&quot;S.2.7.1-S.2.7.3 (FSAE-2027-V1:S.2.7.1:p001 .. S.2.7.3:p001) - evaluation criteria, prototype quality not judged, official score sheet on Event Website&quot;,&quot;S.2.8 (FSAE-2027-V1:S.2.8:p001) - judging may be in several phases&quot;,&quot;S.2.9.1-S.2.9.3 (FSAE-2027-V1:S.2.9.1:p001 .. S.2.9.3:p001) - averaged judge scores, 0-75 range, normalisation/scaling&quot;,&quot;PS.1.1.1-PS.1.2.8 - submission deadlines, published procedures, and definitions (Submission/Due/Cancellation Date, Late, Not Submitted, Amount Late, Grounds for Removal, Reviewer)&quot;,&quot;PS.2.1, PS.2.2, PS.2.2.1-PS.2.2.4 - upload to team account, Table PS-1, templates, single file in specified format&quot;,&quot;PS.3.1.1-PS.3.1.4 - team confirms its own upload; uploads can be replaced without penalty before the Due Date; Reviewer may ask for a revision with a new deadline; no notice is given of an incorrect submission&quot;,&quot;PS.3.2.1-PS.3.2.3, PS.3.3.1-PS.3.3.2 - late/not-submitted penalties and removal&quot;,&quot;TABLE-PS-1 (FSAE-2027-V1:TABLE-PS-1:p007) - Presentation row: requirement, format and file type all point to S.2.4; penalty group Other. Footnotes p014 (template) and p015 (Event Website requirements) are not attached to this row&quot;,&quot;TABLE-PS-2 (FSAE-2027-V1:TABLE-PS-2:p004) - group Other: -20 points per 24 hours late; Not Submitted means removal from the Cost/Design/Presentation event with a score of 0 (see PS.3.2.2)&quot;,&quot;AD.1.3 (FSAE-2027-V1:AD.1.3:p001, p002) - English is the series language and is accepted for submissions and presentations&quot;,&quot;AD.2.1.1-AD.2.1.4 - Event Website Series Resources, team account, Team Captain, only Team Members/Captains upload&quot;,&quot;AD.5.1.3 (FSAE-2027-V1:AD.5.1.3:p004) - Faculty Advisor must not develop documentation or presentation&quot;]"/>
          <ownedAttributes xsi:type="Requirements:StringValueAttribute" id="8f700903-98df-472e-a68b-68679cc9e6b5"
              definition="#80d1a35c-a9c8-40de-a65a-a8e64d29b2ab" value="TBD (set by the Presentation Concept)"/>
