            id="6c236ba1-c741-43c7-8c02-2219eb4e0ec7">
          <bodies>Inspect direct routing and bias circuitry. Fault-inject each open, short, out-of-range and wiring failure; check persistence boundaries and complete motor-power removal. Establish actual sensor ranges and detection coverage. Evidence: unavailable. Status: NOT VERIFIED. Conditions: Candidate analogue BSE. Digital BSE requirements and its form applicability remain unallocated. Source: FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.3:p001, FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.3:p002, FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.3:p003, FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.4:p001, FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.4:p002</bodies>
