          summary="Disconnect each BSE signal through its dedicated inspection interface; demonstrate fault response and verify all unrelated connections remain intact. Evidence: unavailable. Status: NOT VERIFIED. Conditions: All BSE signal connections used by the chosen implementation. Source: FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.2:p001, FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.2:p002, FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.2:p003">
        <ownedSpecification xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information.datavalue:OpaqueExpression"
            id="f120d8fc-e9df-4599-bc0c-484f55cd8bcc">
          <bodies>Disconnect each BSE signal through its dedicated inspection interface; demonstrate fault response and verify all unrelated connections remain intact. Evidence: unavailable. Status: NOT VERIFIED. Conditions: All BSE signal connections used by the chosen implementation. Source: FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.2:p001, FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.2:p002, FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.2:p003</bodies>
