          id="bdbce0c3-131b-4e75-a99c-46e637cd57bc" name="FSAE2027:DD verify DD-14 NOT VERIFIED"
          summary="Inspect stimulus wiring/coil routing through the actual current sensor and the two connection points. Demonstrate the inspection setup exercises the installed BSPD sensing chain rather than bypassing it. Evidence: unavailable. Status: NOT VERIFIED. Conditions: Physical test provision; actual wire/coil and supply design remain unresolved. Source: FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.5:p001, FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.5:p002, FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.5:p003">
