            id="2c6bb9cb-a74c-4da9-8053-9611896c7d93">
          <bodies>Inspect stimulus wiring/coil routing through the actual current sensor and the two connection points. Demonstrate the inspection setup exercises the installed BSPD sensing chain rather than bypassing it. Evidence: unavailable. Status: NOT VERIFIED. Conditions: Physical test provision; actual wire/coil and supply design remain unresolved. Source: FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.5:p001, FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.5:p002, FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.5:p003</bodies>
