          <bodies>Measure jack size and inspect shrouding, colour exclusions and polarity labels. Demonstrate direct accessibility with the actual active-inspection configuration. Evidence: unavailable. Status: NOT VERIFIED. Conditions: Chosen vehicle-mounted candidate; adaptor/breakout is the source alternative. Source: FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.6:p001, FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.6:p002, FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.6:p003, FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.6:p004, FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.6:p005, FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.6:p006, FSAE-2027-V1:EV.8.7.6:p007</bodies>
