          id="c1b4cb1f-3472-30f9-a714-c2cc27626da9" name="FSAE2027:VP Apply tubing classes and material restrictions verification NOT_VERIFIED"
          summary="NOT_VERIFIED. Candidate source-grounded verification; construction and evidence remain unresolved."
