            id="d29a5d21-e299-4155-bb32-a6430bec1294">
          <bodies>Build a member/application/material matrix, confirm each required class and prohibited aluminum application, and exclude nonstructural members from the equivalence/load-path assessment.
Conditions/alternatives: All rows of the application table are preserved as constraints, including battery protection which is only an interface to this slice.
Open choices: Actual member sizes and application/material matrix TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: F.3.4, F.3.5
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
          <languages>Text</languages>
        </ownedSpecification>
