            id="13acb028-09f8-4694-9bb4-1abf50342dbe">
          <bodies>Inspect continuous steel construction, class and brace count; measure angles, spacing and attachment height. Substantiate integration and full load transfer using the applicable chassis/bracing support and joint rules.
Conditions/alternatives: Mandatory steel applications cannot be replaced with the permitted aluminum alternatives for other members.
