            id="36105b8f-b73b-43b4-ae1b-dbeae25f7514">
          <bodies>Review the physical stack and establish transverse/vertical load paths at both attachments under off-axis impact cases.
Conditions/alternatives: All attenuator/AIP construction and attachment variants.
Open choices: Front bulkhead, AIP, attenuator and off-axis load-path design TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: 
