            id="b8f51172-443c-459b-92cd-9869847b94f5">
          <bodies>Select material/attachment, measure the corresponding profile/thickness/fastener/weld geometry and substantiate conditional strength and SES documentation for the selected method. Record the rejected alternatives with rationale.
Conditions/alternatives: Material and attachment alternatives are constraints awaiting a decision, not multiple simultaneously selected designs.
Open choices: AIP material, dimensions and attachment method TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: T.8.2, F.8.5.3
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
