            id="1633f17e-adc8-408c-8664-4e84b6e1c6aa">
          <bodies>Select and substantiate one allowed proof route; check load area, representative fixture and one-year validity for physical tests, or the referenced laminate tests plus both required calculations.
Conditions/alternatives: Only if composite AIP is selected.
Open choices: Composite AIP selection, laminate/test data and proof route TBD.
