      <ownedConstraints xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.capellacore:Constraint"
          id="c613f44c-0e43-339b-a512-47cb57fdcc2a" name="FSAE2027:VP Retain standard/custom attenuator and bulkhead-support alternatives verification NOT_VERIFIED"
          summary="NOT_VERIFIED. Candidate source-grounded verification; construction and evidence remain unresolved."
          constrainedElements="#db1bf125-5330-3fef-913d-5365cd9aab7f #052ba2b8-5209-3aa1-99ce-51eb55d39957 #ef1f0d00-f007-3a47-8bf7-bb723b1b2c90 #fbd35ccd-e300-309b-a64f-30b004a87f46 #c3eda33c-5bf7-30ed-a651-da90fa8e2f38 #e33dae75-9a3b-3822-b382-372f6c891a37 #28b391ad-021f-39ba-ac10-fb4bafe83ae3 #87dff644-a41a-3feb-a7bd-457120b567bd #a38b781a-d3b4-3211-869b-3828344fa293 #4aa2525e-f7cd-38a6-a501-c6687cc41946 #94a3d826-a612-3513-8eb3-df5805639f86 #2904fe19-f7ed-30f3-9664-f8e37fe45fe8 #ed2109e2-36e4-3bfe-ad7d-3586083ae889 #53e89cde-5638-3ca6-9f89-f868f7647f38 #73aa2539-f087-3106-a899-6773dbe53099 #cd5566c8-0d9f-3d3d-aa31-1cd3da537f6c">
        <ownedSpecification xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information.datavalue:OpaqueExpression"
            id="820102ef-6cc0-49f3-b6da-07d9c0667a71">
          <bodies>Pin the event-site approval/specification if standard is chosen; otherwise inspect custom dimensions/segments and obtain applicable tests. Evaluate the bulkhead/honeycomb trigger and establish the selected support or physical-test alternative.
Conditions/alternatives: Standard/custom, foam/honeycomb/other, bulkhead profile and support/test alternatives remain unresolved.
Open choices: Exact approved standard IA or custom construction, bulkhead size and additional support/test choice TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: F.2.3.1, F.8.8.6, F.8.8.7
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
          <languages>Text</languages>
        </ownedSpecification>
      </ownedConstraints>
      <ownedConstraints xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.capellacore:Constraint"
          id="9efb821b-a1b7-3237-9fd1-ff77c0d2ffbb" name="FSAE2027:VP Constrain attenuator attachment and position verification NOT_VERIFIED"
          summary="NOT_VERIFIED. Candidate source-grounded verification; construction and evidence remain unresolved."
          constrainedElements="#db1bf125-5330-3fef-913d-5365cd9aab7f #052ba2b8-5209-3aa1-99ce-51eb55d39957 #ef1f0d00-f007-3a47-8bf7-bb723b1b2c90 #fbd35ccd-e300-309b-a64f-30b004a87f46 #c3eda33c-5bf7-30ed-a651-da90fa8e2f38 #e33dae75-9a3b-3822-b382-372f6c891a37 #28b391ad-021f-39ba-ac10-fb4bafe83ae3 #87dff644-a41a-3feb-a7bd-457120b567bd #a38b781a-d3b4-3211-869b-3828344fa293 #4aa2525e-f7cd-38a6-a501-c6687cc41946 #94a3d826-a612-3513-8eb3-df5805639f86 #2904fe19-f7ed-30f3-9664-f8e37fe45fe8 #ed2109e2-36e4-3bfe-ad7d-3586083ae889 #53e89cde-5638-3ca6-9f89-f868f7647f38 #73aa2539-f087-3106-a899-6773dbe53099 #cd5566c8-0d9f-3d3d-aa31-1cd3da537f6c #9b3e192f-3521-316f-8bf0-e48458b0fbd2 #abe4bd66-8c9a-3148-b9a0-eeac1526abd4 #dba98e8d-7e7b-3016-a38f-be0fa578f2a7 #038d55a2-c6f0-3222-a40c-f2e40626272a #c258e9c9-2f1c-300e-b66e-a42153e5b315 #4b8c16a6-6bdc-345c-9983-b7ce947ff5cd #2a4bab68-e686-37ff-8448-0c0397e28caa #917d1835-b56e-3d83-a3ed-058089d41de4">
        <ownedSpecification xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information.datavalue:OpaqueExpression"
            id="79d90a1a-3db6-4a02-a337-c096ba6762da">
          <bodies>For the chosen IA variant inspect the allowed attachment, strength/provenance, weld/bolt/bond details, low-mounted area and orientation; include the exact method in SES.
Conditions/alternatives: IA/AIP choices remain unresolved. Preserve the different inequalities: AIP weld length >=25 mm versus IA weld length >25 mm.
Open choices: Attenuator type, attachment strengths, mounting height and orientation TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: F.5.5, T.8.2
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
          <languages>Text</languages>
        </ownedSpecification>
      </ownedConstraints>
      <ownedConstraints xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.capellacore:Constraint"
          id="fb2ad4c6-2c78-3f23-8b80-71c3ae35ffa8" name="FSAE2027:VP Prevent front intrusion and preserve pedal clearance verification NOT_VERIFIED"
          summary="NOT_VERIFIED. Candidate source-grounded verification; construction and evidence remain unresolved."
          constrainedElements="#db1bf125-5330-3fef-913d-5365cd9aab7f #052ba2b8-5209-3aa1-99ce-51eb55d39957 #ef1f0d00-f007-3a47-8bf7-bb723b1b2c90 #fbd35ccd-e300-309b-a64f-30b004a87f46 #c3eda33c-5bf7-30ed-a651-da90fa8e2f38 #e33dae75-9a3b-3822-b382-372f6c891a37 #28b391ad-021f-39ba-ac10-fb4bafe83ae3 #87dff644-a41a-3feb-a7bd-457120b567bd #9b3e192f-3521-316f-8bf0-e48458b0fbd2 #abe4bd66-8c9a-3148-b9a0-eeac1526abd4 #dba98e8d-7e7b-3016-a38f-be0fa578f2a7 #038d55a2-c6f0-3222-a40c-f2e40626272a #c258e9c9-2f1c-300e-b66e-a42153e5b315 #4b8c16a6-6bdc-345c-9983-b7ce947ff5cd #2a4bab68-e686-37ff-8448-0c0397e28caa #917d1835-b56e-3d83-a3ed-058089d41de4 #9198d5f0-9b96-3a8a-a879-13e1df9f0b1a #c4a0d808-1cad-3d0b-8900-b2dde4e9ed7c #9d0880bf-8501-3c34-bb9a-a1504f84fe57 #dcbf78e0-d2bb-3009-935e-e6c7456b0a7e #ed0edd9f-e0b3-32fd-887f-b46ff04ed256 #c10c305b-39f9-3070-9662-607471afc21e #06a81ec3-89fa-3a4d-b54d-8de24e9060b3 #8a7a6d43-e5de-33d0-b8fb-7e59f88b087b">
        <ownedSpecification xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information.datavalue:OpaqueExpression"
            id="cf5a7003-7774-41a9-b646-37d5391178ad">
          <bodies>Inventory front-view objects, inspect tab protrusion and evaluate wing/mount crash movement if present. Sweep pedal adjustments/full travel and measure clearance to every protected structure/noncrushable object.
Conditions/alternatives: Optional wing/bodywork installations trigger their attachment/motion conditions; pedal adjustment sweep is mandatory.
Open choices: Front packaging, aerodynamic devices, adjustment ranges and collision/motion evidence TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: F.6.1, F.7.2, F.8.4.3
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
          <languages>Text</languages>
        </ownedSpecification>
      </ownedConstraints>
      <ownedConstraints xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.capellacore:Constraint"
          id="7c1a3c66-ca8d-3669-bc40-21ecb34e1792" name="FSAE2027:VP Combine attenuator and other frontal-object forces verification NOT_VERIFIED"
          summary="NOT_VERIFIED. Candidate source-grounded verification; construction and evidence remain unresolved."
