            id="d64c5a7a-9aa8-4831-b379-8f98f7ca8652">
          <bodies>Inventory included/excluded frontal objects and select an allowed test/calculation route. Check each failure mode and the correctly matched attenuator peak against the functional deceleration reference.
Conditions/alternatives: The applicable material-dependent peak must be selected after IA choice, not combined or universally substituted.
Open choices: Front objects/mount failures, IA peak, proof route and combined force evidence TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: 
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
          <languages>Text</languages>
        </ownedSpecification>
      </ownedConstraints>
