          id="87c82ff3-d5a4-3690-bff5-af24edde0148" name="FSAE2027:VP Keep the functional impact reference separate from test criteria verification NOT_VERIFIED"
          summary="NOT_VERIFIED. Candidate source-grounded verification; construction and evidence remain unresolved."
