        <ownedSpecification xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information.datavalue:OpaqueExpression"
            id="8bb1687d-6071-4ea5-ad6d-5c8c7a283bf5">
          <bodies>Review the IAD functional demonstration and its mass/speed/energy/deceleration derivation; assess test interpretation under the remaining F.8.8 clauses before claiming acceptance.
Conditions/alternatives: Reference impact conditions are preserved, while actual vehicle mass and the substantiation method remain separate design/evidence decisions.
Open choices: Actual vehicle design mass, IA performance and complete IAD evidence TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: 
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
          <languages>Text</languages>
        </ownedSpecification>
      </ownedConstraints>
      <ownedConstraints xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.capellacore:Constraint"
          id="875a61bb-64ef-3136-a6b9-6d710b5847a5" name="FSAE2027:VP Plan the applicable impact report, fixture, conduct and analysis verification NOT_VERIFIED"
