        <ownedSpecification xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information.datavalue:OpaqueExpression"
            id="9d856ab8-5a1b-4d1a-b5f9-eff48153f562">
          <bodies>Develop the applicable IAD package; review year validity, intended assembly and representative fixture, clearances/deflection, facility/supervision and test data. Reproduce average from raw data and document any allowed filtering of peaks.
Conditions/alternatives: Standard/custom and composite/noncomposite alternatives determine the evidence obligations; no test or approval is performed by model creation.
Open choices: IA selection, dedicated facility, fixtures, current-year test data and official standard specification TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: F.8.8.2
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
