            id="3973fc48-0712-4c5a-aaf6-1130783a9bd4">
          <bodies>Construct the exact official gauge and document permitted/forbidden removals, unchanged firewall, routing and fixed supports. Demonstrate insertion to both limits without replacing the prescribed geometry.
Conditions/alternatives: Gauge outline and orientation are checked visually against the source drawing; T.1.2 internal cross-section remains outside this bounded interpretation.
Open choices: Cockpit opening/bodywork geometry, removable equipment and physical gauge demonstration TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: F.6.4, F.7.5.1, T.1.2
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
          <languages>Text</languages>
        </ownedSpecification>
      </ownedConstraints>
      <ownedConstraints xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.capellacore:Constraint"
          id="4274bbc3-e13f-31d0-8223-a9ff36b385dd" name="FSAE2027:VP Contain the occupant and shield moving/sharp hazards verification NOT_VERIFIED"
          summary="NOT_VERIFIED. Candidate source-grounded verification; construction and evidence remain unresolved."
