            id="0fd4dc34-3a89-455f-bba8-fed69788185f">
          <bodies>Check hips/feet/legs for all drivers and pedal settings, inspect the full hazard zone and removable shields, and measure the selected seat-protection alternative.
Conditions/alternatives: Seat protection alternatives remain unresolved; shields are functional hazards barriers, not permanent inspection obstructions.
Open choices: Cockpit fit, hazard shields, seat and protection layout TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: 
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
          <languages>Text</languages>
        </ownedSpecification>
      </ownedConstraints>
      <ownedConstraints xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.capellacore:Constraint"
          id="71d6f5fe-72ef-3195-a5a5-f8d21eacc8b9" name="FSAE2027:VP Exclude track debris with a continuous floor closeout verification NOT_VERIFIED"
