            id="1ef75946-4625-4a0c-b40a-2384a7859ee7">
          <bodies>Inspect material, foot-to-firewall coverage and every panel gap; demonstrate debris exclusion and attachment integrity under the selected environment.
Conditions/alternatives: All vehicles; panel count and material remain unresolved.
Open choices: Floor material, joints and attachment design TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: 
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
          <languages>Text</languages>
