        <ownedSpecification xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information.datavalue:OpaqueExpression"
            id="2de21f05-e308-4f27-a1ac-9de4a4d74729">
          <bodies>Select posture and harness, audit original manufacturer certification/expiration/condition/instructions/unmodified hardware, count belt paths and inspect required adjusters/strap geometry. Review all referenced mounting clauses separately.
Conditions/alternatives: Posture, exact harness and certificate/specification remain unselected. Belt mount strength/angles are not claimed by this specification-only group.
Open choices: Driving posture, harness model, expiration, manufacturer documentation and mounting design TBD.
Dependencies outside this bounded interpretation: T.2.4, T.2.5, T.2.6, T.2.7
NOT_VERIFIED: a verification obligation, not an executed test or compliance statement.</bodies>
          <languages>Text</languages>
        </ownedSpecification>
      </ownedConstraints>
