            id="10dcba24-378f-4c36-ac55-f81f1090eede">
          <bodies>Inspect approved padding/cover/hole, containment and item exclusion; measure fit for all drivers and the selected geometry alternative. Substantiate mounts under loads applied anywhere with the strict strength inequalities.
Conditions/alternatives: All drivers; material/area-adjustment versus fixed-height alternative and protection-envelope choice remain unresolved.
